This partition preserves 12,478 retained public image URL-version records.
The first image partition and eight byte-exact recovered historical aliases are
separate immutable backups. Their target version IDs do not overlap this set.

For each target ID, read its metadata from this immutable manifest, fetch the
content-addressed object from the SAME Git commit, and verify its SHA256,
original SHA1 and exact byte count before importing it. Identical byte payloads
may share an object; every public version ID remains separately represented.
The full public file inventory and its closing metadata checkpoint are included.
Nonimage uploads are preserved in a separate immutable partition.

This is a public-source checkpoint through 2026-11-14 18:56 UTC. Later changes
require a new delta checkpoint. No Archive.org request or production wiki import
is claimed by this partition. The complete coverage map links all four partitions.
